      "content": "For your group of 8 engineers, I recommend checking if your airlines offer \"Transit Without Visa\" (TWOV) privileges for Vietnam and Singapore, as this avoids needing a separate visa for layovers. Even if eligible, verify your arrival procedures align with international transit rules in Thailand to prevent unexpected border detentions. Finally, ensure all passport validity exceeds six months for your entire itinerary across these three countries. This simple checklist should keep your team moving smoothly without delays.",
